test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8849815Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8850094Z                         goal.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8850331Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8850604Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8850876Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8851163Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8851449Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8851763Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8852012Z                         field solution.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8852277Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8852561Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8852877Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8853212Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8853480Z                         local solver jobs.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8853699Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8853963Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8854278Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8854603Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8854873Z                         not manufacturability.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8855148Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8855473Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8855727Z                         processor works.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8855987Z     pdk                 Foundry PDK abstraction: list registered technologies
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8856286Z                         or inspect a PDK's full provenance and process
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8856539Z                         parameters.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8856810Z     measurement         Simulation-vs-measurement correlation: the path from
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8857141Z                         illustrative to fab-calibrated numbers.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8857596Z     kqcircuits-cpw      Generate verified straight CPW gap masks via an
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8859961Z                         isolated KQCircuits runtime; no EM simulation.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8860856Z     quantum-metal-mask  Generate independently checked charge-pad/ground
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8861397Z                         masks; no junction or EM simulation.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8861972Z     pyepr-circuit       Run an ideal one-mode circuit with
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8862380Z                         convergence/reference checks; no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8862829Z     circuitq-lc         Run ideal LC with fixed grid/domain/reference checks;
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8863217Z                         no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8863612Z     sqcircuit-lc        Run specified ideal LC with fixed eigenpair/reference
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8864019Z                         checks; no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8864404Z     squadds-prior       Read a pinned offline WM1 frequency prior; no
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-17T00:42:02.8864811Z                         simulation or network.
